but I think that is the very unlikely situation. Which just gives me further corroboration to continue hammering at Nvidia, as the bloated hog of the stock market. </p><p class=\"button-wrapper\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://tjstocks.substack.com/subscribe?&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Subscribe now&quot;,&quot;action&quot;:null,&quot;class&quot;:null}\" data-component-name=\"ButtonCreateButton\"><a class=\"button primary\" href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/subscribe?\"><span>Subscribe now</span></a></p><h4>There are better stocks to buy. </h4><p>If you did not see <strong><a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/weekly-wrap-the-market-flipped-bullish-44f?r=4z8lgl\">yesterday’s “Weekly Wrap” post (click here)</a></strong><a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/weekly-wrap-the-market-flipped-bullish-44f?r=4z8lgl\">,</a> I have linked inside 2 posts: 3 stocks I am targeting for entries, along with Mid Week Movers from this week that has 2 recession resistant stocks that look optimal for entries… and I think will vastly outperform something like Nvidia. </p><p>Have a nice Sunday, and thanks for stopping by! </p><h4>If you like this content, please LIKE ❤️ and Re-stack 🔄 </h4><div class=\"captioned-button-wrap\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/nvidia-investors-should-be-careful?utm_source=substack&utm_medium=email&utm_content=share&action=share&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Share&quot;}\" data-component-name=\"CaptionedButtonToDOM\"><div class=\"preamble\"><p class=\"cta-caption\">Know someone into investing? Share this post with them!</p></div><p class=\"button-wrapper\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/nvidia-investors-should-be-careful?utm_source=substack&utm_medium=email&utm_content=share&action=share&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Share&quot;}\" data-component-name=\"ButtonCreateButton\"><a class=\"button primary\" href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/nvidia-investors-should-be-careful?utm_source=substack&utm_medium=email&utm_content=share&action=share\"><span>Share</span></a></p></div><div class=\"footnote\" data-component-name=\"FootnoteToDOM\"><a id=\"footnote-1\" href=\"#footnote-anchor-1\" class=\"footnote-number\" contenteditable=\"false\" target=\"_self\">1</a><div class=\"footnote-content\"><p>https://www.marketscreener.com/news/nvidia-considers-10-billion-investment-in-anthropica-s-stock-market-flotation-ce785bdcd98ff220</p></div></div><div class=\"footnote\" data-component-name=\"FootnoteToDOM\"><a id=\"footnote-2\" href=\"#footnote-anchor-2\" class=\"footnote-number\" contenteditable=\"false\" target=\"_self\">2</a><div class=\"footnote-content\"><p>https://www.cnbc.com/2026/03/11/oracle-tiktok-us-stake-outages.html</p></div></div>",
